WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:12.413
I love reading books!

2
00:00:12.414 --> 00:00:14.876
Tom: This is our public library.

3
00:00:14.877 --> 00:00:18.342
Hana: So many books!

4
00:00:18.343 --> 00:00:20.079
Tom: Do you like to read?

5
00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:24.574
Hana & Bada: Yes!

6
00:00:24.575 --> 00:00:26.798
Tom: What kind of books do you like?

7
00:00:26.799 --> 00:00:29.530
Hana: I like fairy tales.

8
00:00:29.531 --> 00:00:34.612
Bada: I like COMIC BOOKS!

9
00:00:34.613 --> 00:00:37.827
Librarian: SHH! Please be quiet!

10
00:00:37.828 --> 00:00:40.603
Bada: Oh, sorry!

11
00:00:40.604 --> 00:00:45.832
Tom: We have to be quiet in the library.

12
00:00:45.833 --> 00:00:50.700
Bada: Can I . . . ? Oops! Can I read here?

13
00:00:50.701 --> 00:00:53.695
Hana: Can I look around by myself?

14
00:00:53.696 --> 00:00:57.010
Tom: Sure, but come back here, okay?

15
00:00:57.011 --> 00:01:04.968
Hana: Okay! I love fairy tales.

16
00:01:04.969 --> 00:01:08.105
And I love mysteries.

17
00:01:08.106 --> 00:01:12.753
Hana: Oh, and I really love animal stories.

18
00:01:12.754 --> 00:01:17.917
I am interested in science too.

19
00:01:17.918 --> 00:01:21.824
Hana: Tom, how many books can I borrow?

20
00:01:21.825 --> 00:01:24.324
Tom: Only five books, Hana.

21
00:01:24.325 --> 00:01:28.034
After you finish them, we can come back.

22
00:01:28.035 --> 00:01:32.356
Hana: Oh! Thank you!

23
00:01:32.357 --> 00:01:35.112
Librarian: Do you have a library card?

24
00:01:35.113 --> 00:01:37.119
Tom: Yes, here you go.

25
00:01:37.120 --> 00:01:40.758
Librarian: You must return these books by next week.

26
00:01:40.759 --> 00:01:44.881
Hana & Bada: Bye!

27
00:01:44.882 --> 00:01:51.073
I can't wait to go back to the library next week.
